          <li>MHCLG, Private Parking Code of Practice 2026: Explanatory Memorandum (laid 20 October 2026; in force 21 days after issue; transitional arrangements to follow). <strong>Primary.</strong> <a href="https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/private-parking-code-of-practice-2026-explanatory-memorandum/private-parking-code-of-practice-2026-explanatory-memorandum" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GOV.UK</a></li>
